    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">at
    market prices prevailing at the time of sale;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
